bots: a bot's arrows in PvP are used up, never dropped (pvp_ranged.rs2)

A PK bot's arrows come with its kit (120-250 rune arrows at every restock: port/BotPkFight) and it
never picks one up, so 274's drop under the target (4 in 5 shots, the shooter's for 100 ticks, then
anyone's) left free rune arrows about Edgeville for the human to take. A bot's arrow now goes the
way of the fifth one (inv_del), like the rest of its kit at a death (0003). In the Duel Arena it
still goes to the duel's arrows; a human's arrows drop as before.

diff --git a/scripts/skill_combat/scripts/pvp/pvp_ranged.rs2 b/scripts/skill_combat/scripts/pvp/pvp_ranged.rs2
index 75ecc65..1c4a2c5 100644
